    "title": "Data for \"One-minute frequency disturbances from unintended synchronization in cyber\u2013physical power systems.\"",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21997337",
    "publication_date": "2026-08-18",
    "description": "<h1>Data for the paper \"One-minute frequency disturbances from unintended synchronization in cyber&ndash;physical power systems.\"</h1>\n<p>This folder contains all the data, <strong>which were not already public available</strong>, that have been used to generate the results in the manuscript.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Campus Data</strong>: Contains the data from Forschungszentrum J&uuml;lich.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Laptop Data</strong>: Contains the data of the Laptop test.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Smart Household Devices</strong>: Contains the data of the Smart Devices test.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Grid Frequency Data:</strong> Contains the grid frequency data from the United States (Western and Eastern Interconnection), Australia, Iceland, South Korea, Malaysia, and Mallorca.</p>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Raspberry PI Data</strong>: Contains the data of the Raspberry Pi test.</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Source Data Figure:</strong> Contains the source data for the figures of the Paper</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Warning: </strong>The UPS_DC_#.csv values represent the data directly obtained by the MODBUS register of the UPS. The values must be multipluied by 0.1 (parameter provided by the manufacturer) to obtain the values in Ampere (A).</p>\n<p>Please acknowledge the usage of the data by citing this paper:</p>\n<p><strong>Hartmann, Carsten, et al. \"Cyber-Physical Systems on the Megawatt Scale: The impact of battery control on grid frequency stability.\"<em> arXiv preprint arXiv:2510.09862</em> (2025). DOI: &nbsp;<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2510.09862\">https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2510.09862</a></strong></p>",
